  "description": "Diagnoses and fixes misbehaving ADK Dart agents and workflows using Event stream inspection, DebugLoggingPlugin, adk web HTTP/SSE endpoints (/run, /run_sse, /debug/trace), and known ADK Dart failure modes. Use when an agent produces wrong or empty output, calls the wrong tool, skips tools when outputSchema is set, throws ArgumentError/StateError on LlmAgent or Workflow construction, pauses unexpectedly on RequestInput or confirmation, or fails to see parent context across subAgents / task branches. Don't use for creating a new agent from scratch (use adk-dart-agent-builder).",
